<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="x4275" n="Humphrey, Solomon, Jr.">Brother <choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">umpry</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear"/></choice>
<supplied resp="WordConversion">Solomon Humphrey Jr.</supplied></ref> came
<lb/>to see me from the East <choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">&amp; <lb/>braught</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">and
