              </choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">,</reg><note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e2962" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote">This meteor display, caused by
                debris from comet Tempel-Tuttle, is one of the more spectacular of all recorded
