<lb/><ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per75" n="Sidney Rigdon"><choice><reg resp="DarowskiJF" type="Expanded">brother</reg><reg resp="DarowskiJF" type="Clear">Brother</reg></choice> Sidney</ref><choice><reg resp="DarowskiJF" type="Expanded">,</reg><reg resp="DarowskiJF" type="Clear"/></choice>
also<choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">,
not<lb/>withstanding</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">.
Notwithstanding</reg></choice> he shall be high <lb/>and lifted up, yet he
