newspaper.<note type="comment-external" corresp="X6E65D2F5-FD22-4DB9-9A38-45CB9F69B4FD"/></note> The council also
resolved to continue publication of
<ref target="X6047" pm:link-pointer-type="source"><abbr><title>The Evening and
