<ref target="X0918" pm:link-pointer-type="source"><abbr>Crawley,
<title>Descriptive Bibliography,</title> 47–53</abbr></ref>.</note></note>
<lb/>I ask God in the
<pb xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e3919" type="present" n="28" facs="6662_MS155_1_01_JSJ-1_028.jpg"/> name of Jesus to estab<lb/>lish it
<choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">for ever</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">forever</reg></choice> and <lb/>cause that his
