<lb/>his great work in <lb/>bringing about the <lb/><ref pm:link-pointer-type="topic" target="x4084">restoration of the <lb/>house of
Israel</ref><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">.</reg><note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e3947" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote">Drawing upon biblical prophecies, many early
