“gathering” through which all who accepted the message of the restored gospel,
were baptized and confirmed into the church, and immigrated to Mormon gathering
centers would receive the blessings promised to Jacob’s descendants.<note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e3968" type="toe-note" resp="s" pm:link-target-type="text">See, for example,
