<p xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e6425" rend="indent">The following section of the journal,
through the beginning of the entry for <date when-iso="1834-03-14">14
March</date>, was kept by
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per117" n="Parley P. Pratt">Parley
P. Pratt</ref> for both
