<ab xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e9118" rend="noindent" type="journal-entry-divider"><date when-iso="1834-04-20">20 April 1834</date> • Sunday</ab> 
<p xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e9121" rend="indent"><choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded"><del resp="Conversion">18</del> <date when-iso="1834-04-20">20<hi rend="superscript">th.</hi> Sunday</date>,
</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear"/></choice>Brother
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per75" n="Sidney Rigdon">Sidney
<lb/>Rigdon</ref> entertained a large con<lb/>gregation of <choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">saints</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">Saints</reg></choice><choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">,</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear"/></choice> with an
<lb/>interesting discourse upon <lb/>the “<ref pm:link-pointer-type="topic" target="x4078"><choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">Dispensation</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">dispensation</reg></choice><del resp="Conversion">s</del></ref> of
the ful<lb/>ness of times,” <choice><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Expanded">&amp;c</reg><reg resp="darowskijf" type="Clear">etc</reg></choice>.<note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e9150" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote"><ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per75" n="Sidney Rigdon">Rigdon</ref>
preached in
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="place" target="plc97" n="Norton Medina County Ohio United States">Norton</ref>, Ohio. A note in the
