prayer, The
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per46" n="Smith, Joseph, Jr.">Pres<hi rend="superscript">t.</hi></ref> then arose
<lb/>&amp; said he would call upon the church to know <lb/>if they were
sattisfied with their
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="topic" target="x4086" n="High Council">High
Council</ref> <lb/>and should proceed to name them individualy <lb/><ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per556" n="Johnson, John">John
