1838</date> for <lb/>the aniversary of the organization of the chur<lb/>ch,
Also to transact Church buisness,</p> <p xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e48233" rend="indent">Presidents
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per46" n="Smith, Joseph, Jr.">Joseph
Smith Jr</ref> &amp;
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per75" n="Rigdon, Sidney">Sidney
Rigdon</ref> <lb/><del resp="Conversion">Presided</del>
