Morey</ref> &amp;
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per1145" n="Huntington, Dimick Baker">Demick <supplied resp="WordConversion">Dimick</supplied> Hun<lb/>tington</ref>, were appointed
Sexton and door <lb/>keepers
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per504" n="Corrill, John">John
