<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per84" n="Higbee, Elias">Elias
<del resp="Conversion">Higby</del> Higbee</ref> <add resp="WordConversion">Historians</add> <lb/>3
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per108" n="Marsh, Thomas Baldwin">T<supplied resp="WordConversion">homas</supplied> B.
Marsh</ref>,
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per609" n="Patten, David">D<supplied resp="WordConversion">avid</supplied> W. Patten</ref>, &amp;
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per168" n="Young, Brigham">B<supplied resp="WordConversion">righam</supplied>
Young</ref> of the <lb/><ref pm:link-pointer-type="topic" target="x4111" n="Twelve Apostles">twelve</ref> were appointed Presidents Pro. Tem <lb/>of the
<del resp="Conversion">city</del> <del resp="Conversion">of</del>
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="place" target="plc137" n="Far West, Rockford (now in Mirabile) Township, Caldwell County, Missouri"><del resp="Conversion">Far</del> <del resp="Conversion">West</del></ref>
<add resp="WordConversion">Church of Christ of L.D. Saints in
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="place" target="plc140" n="Missouri, United States">Missouri</ref>.</add>, as the former <lb/>Pres.
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per69" n="Whitmer, David">D<supplied resp="WordConversion">avid</supplied> Whitmer</ref>
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per73" n="Phelps, William Wines">W.
W. Phelphs <supplied resp="WordConversion">William W. Phelps</supplied></ref>
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per70" n="Whitmer, John">John
<lb/>Whitmer</ref> had been put out of their office<note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e48344" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote"><ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per168" n="Young, Brigham">Young</ref> now joined
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per108" n="Marsh, Thomas Baldwin">Marsh</ref> and
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per609" n="Patten, David">Patten</ref> as presidents pro tempore. The three most senior
members of the Quorum of the Twelve now presided over the church in
