<ab xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e58467" rend="noindent" type="journal-entry-divider"><date from-iso="1838-08-07" to-iso="1838-08-09">7–9 August 1838</date> •
Tuesday–Thursday</ab> <p xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e58470" rend="indent"><date when-iso="1838-08-07">Tuesday the 7<hi rend="superscript">th</hi></date> This
morning an <ref pm:link-pointer-type="event" target="x5131">alarm come</ref>
