suffered to be intered, and that the majority <lb/>of that county were
determined to drive the
<pb xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e58527" type="present" n="65" facs="6664_CR500-2_v5_JSJ-3_065.jpg"/> bretheren from the county, under these
conciderat<lb/>ions quite a number of us volunteered to go to <lb/>the
assistance of our bretheren in that place accor<lb/>dingly some 15 or 20 men
started from this <lb/>place armed and equipt for our defence<note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e58538" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote">Danite general
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per772" n="Avard, Sampson">Sampson
