<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per294" n="Wight, Lyman">Col.
<supplied resp="WordConversion">Lyman</supplied> Wight</ref>s we had quite
<lb/>a large company Pres<hi rend="superscript">t.</hi><hi rend="superscript"><add resp="WordConversion">s.</add></hi>
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per46" n="Smith, Joseph, Jr.">Smith</ref> and
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per75" n="Rigdon, Sidney"><supplied resp="WordConversion">Sidney</supplied> Rigdon</ref> <lb/>and
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per66" n="Smith, Hyrum">H<supplied resp="WordConversion">yrum</supplied> Smith</ref>, alll the
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="topic" target="x4083" n="First Presidency">first
presidency</ref>,
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per84" n="Higbee, Elias">General
<lb/><supplied resp="WordConversion">Elias</supplied> Higbee</ref>
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per772" n="Avard, Sampson">Gen.
<supplied resp="WordConversion">Sampson</supplied> Avard</ref>
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per217" n="Robinson, George W.">myself</ref><note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e58633" pm:link-target-type="text" type="editorial-footnote"><ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per84" n="Higbee, Elias">Higbee</ref> was
