<lb/>like tigers they cleared the ground at that time, <lb/>in knocking down
and drag<supplied resp="WordConversion">g</supplied>ing out, the principal
<lb/>men who faught so bravely were
<ref pm:link-pointer-type="person" target="per1152" n="Butler, John L.">John L
