<ref pm:link-pointer-type="place" target="plc148" n="Caldwell County, Missouri, United States">Caldwell</ref>.”<note xml:id="JSPPJ1_d1e58923" type="toe-note" resp="s" pm:link-target-type="text"><ref target="X5177" pm:link-pointer-type="source"><abbr>William W. Phelps, Far West, MO, 7 [July]
