<ref target="XX5177" pm:link-pointer-type="source"><abbr><ref pm:link-pointer-type="relatedDocument" target="x412">JS, Affidavit, Caldwell
Co., MO, 5 Sept. 1838</ref>, JS Collection,
CHL</abbr></ref>; <ref target="X8578" pm:link-pointer-type="source"><abbr>Robert Wilson, Gallatin, MO, to James
Minor, Jefferson City, MO, 18 Mar. 1841, in <title>Document Containing the
Correspondence,</title> 161–162</abbr></ref>.</note> Later that day, Black
